<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Richman et al. (1975) & Tallinen et al. (2014, 2016) neo-Hookean constrained cortical expansion and sulcal creasing instability — Code-to-model traceability: 68/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Documents the sulcal wavelength formula (L40-44), but lacks explicit mappings to Richman et al. (1975) Table 1, Tallinen et al. (2014) Eq. 1 & Fig. 1-4, Tallinen et al. (2016) Fig. 2-4, and the 3 Lean 4 theorems in `Loop_061_cortical_gyrification_folding.lean`." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/code-traceability" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "1975-richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling.py L40–L66: Brief docstrings without explicit paper figure/table or Lean 4 theorem cross-references <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8871db0/1975-richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling.py#L40-L66>" ;
    pk:hasScore 6.8e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "mostly faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Richman et al. (1975) & Tallinen et al. (2014, 2016) neo-Hookean constrained cortical expansion and sulcal creasing instability — Model fidelity to source: 57/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Computes the exact Richman-Tallinen sulcal wavelength scaling lambda = 2*pi*h*(mu_c/(3*mu_s))^(1/3) and enforces the critical threshold g_c = 1.18 (L34-44), backed by 3 Lean 4 theorems in `Loop_061_cortical_gyrification_folding.lean`. However, `generate_parametric_coronal_contour` (L46-66) uses a synthetic rectified-sine ansatz rather than relaxing a coupled 2D neo-Hookean cortical shell + soft white-matter core energy functional with sulcal self-contact, and omits polymicrogyric, lissencephalic, and zero-growth (g=1.0) controls." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "1975-richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling.py L46–L66: Parametric rectified-sine coronal contour instead of neo-Hookean elastic energy minimization <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8871db0/1975-richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling.py#L46-L66>" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling-model-fidelity-1> ;
    pk:hasScore 5.7e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Richman et al. (1975) & Tallinen et al. (2014, 2016) neo-Hookean constrained cortical expansion and sulcal creasing instability — Morphometric validation: 56/100" ;
