    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling-measurement-human-fetal-gw26-gw38-sulcal-wavelength-correlation>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling-measurement-human-gw38-predicted-gyrification-index-gi-pred>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling-measurement-human-gw38-predicted-sulcal-wavelength-lambda-pred> ;
    pk:hasScore 5.6e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Richman et al. (1975) & Tallinen et al. (2014, 2016) neo-Hookean constrained cortical expansion and sulcal creasing instability — MorphoEval overall 54.4/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 1 (v1) baseline evaluation of `1975-richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling.py` (overall weighted score: 56.2/100). The v1 script implements Richman et al.'s (1975) and Tallinen et al.'s (2014) cube-root sulcal wavelength law lambda = 2*pi*h*(mu_c/(3*mu_s))^(1/3) and evaluates human fetal stages GW22-GW38, but prescribes a synthetic harmonic contour rather than minimizing a coupled neo-Hookean cortical shell + subcortical white-matter elastic energy functional, omits the 11-species mammalian scaling collapse and pathological polymicrogyria / lissencephaly / zero-growth controls, and does not segment the vendored coronal human cerebral cortex specimen image. Overall 54.4/100 (faithfulness 47.6, reproducibility 70.0); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 8871db0; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 57, Morphological realism / specimen match 35, Parameter expressivity 48, Morphometric validation 56, Source and data traceability 74, Code-to-model traceability 68, Reproducibility package 68. Output judged: docs/media/cortical_gyrification_folding_comparison.png: rendered output of 1975-richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling.py at 8871db0, image/png, 141810 B, 1430×1105 px, artifact_sha256 a3439bd2af0d39888b7d97818bb3c6df90fc06cc8c5b30aa22d7cd40325ecd31 (sha256 a3439bd2af0d39888b7d97818bb3c6df90fc06cc8c5b30aa22d7cd40325ecd31), spec_fingerprint b7b9a6e07287630e2e4e6277f4842e9ba61e2c8da24f1f7145e6787809fe3f06. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: b7b9a6e07287630e2e4e6277f4842e9ba61e2c8da24f1f7145e6787809fe3f06; artifact_sha256: a3439bd2af0d39888b7d97818bb3c6df90fc06cc8c5b30aa22d7cd40325ecd31; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/cortical_gyrification_folding/cerebral_cortex_gyri_specimen.jpg=ff9a25e993fd5aad..., datasets/cortical_gyrification_folding/cortical_gyrification_folding_reference.json=cee775390f805000..., datasets/cortical_gyrification_folding/paper_citations.bib=56bc1d0beedebe37..., datasets/cortical_gyrification_folding/scout_manifest.json=7f5410ff8ad2c1ee...}." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Add runtime SHA-256 verification of all 4 files in `datasets/cortical_gyrification_folding/`, expose full CLI parameters (`--growth-g`, `--h-cortex`, `--mu-ratio`, `--R-brain`, `--seed`), and expand `self_test()` and `measure_morphoeval()` to 9 quantitative reference-anchored metrics.",
        "remediation needed: Evaluate the full 11-species mammalian comparative scaling collapse (Mouse, Rat, Ferret, Marmoset, Cat, Bottlenose dolphin, Capuchin, Rhesus macaque, Sheep, Chimpanzee, Human) alongside Richman et al. (1975) polymicrogyria (h = 0.85 mm), lissencephaly (h = 6.50 mm, g < g_c), and zero-growth (g = 1.00) negative controls.",
        "remediation needed: Implement computer-vision segmentation of `datasets/cortical_gyrification_folding/cerebral_cortex_gyri_specimen.jpg` to isolate the cortical gray-matter ribbon, white-matter core, outer convex hull perimeter P_hull, pial perimeter P_pial, empirical specimen Gyrification Index GI, and inter-sulcal wavelength CV.",
        "remediation needed: Replace the parametric coronal curve with a genuine 2D neo-Hookean multiplicative-growth (F = F_e G) cortical shell + soft subcortical white-matter core elastic energy minimizer (L-BFGS-B relaxation of tangential compression, bending stiffness B_c ~ mu_c h^3, white-matter radial/shear foundation stiffness, and sulcal self-contact) and measure emergent GI = P_pial / P_hull and sulcal wavelength directly from the relaxed contour." ;
    pk:hasScore 5.44e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling-parameter-expressivity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Richman et al. (1975) & Tallinen et al. (2014, 2016) neo-Hookean constrained cortical expansion and sulcal creasing instability — Parameter expressivity: 48/100" ;
